.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/V025-ENGINE-STAGE4H-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:42:The corrected immutable sweep is `.tmp/stage4h/quantile-sweep-corrected.json` (file SHA-256 `288f87a42df57e111d4f6bee7a94c04e6b9292a123e95106c72e9ab2d9cf2565`, receipt `4b8bb4ce3f106127ad2f03cf610047685a408aa845f9124086a0f747a4f898a6`). It uses common `V025_SMOKE/world/1` exogenous data, two closed-loop anchors, 14 independently carried arm states, four workers, deadline/fallback accounting and realised 48-boundary endpoints.
