.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/probe/QUANTILE-SWEEP-SMOKE-2026-09-09.md:20:For the set-level FULL arm, every variant reached the same two-step BASE-fallback trajectory: 71.728549 Gbit, 12,675.247 J, 5.658947 Mbit/J and availability 0.453138. FULL recorded two deadline fallbacks; certified S_UNI reached the same endpoint totals with no deadline miss. This equality is reported as observed, not promoted into a robustness claim beyond this quarantined two-anchor smoke.
